5,1,1,talk,Minako,,Let's find a sustainable system for the year. I'll look into the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the standard terms of the outside firm to get a sense of the actual workload.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree, we need a system that actually lasts. I'll examine a fortnight's watch on kitchen use and the absences on the wall calendar to see how our habits align with the work.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to solve the mystery of the messy rooms! I'll check what each housemate counts as done and the rows recorded in the house chat to see why we're fighting!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I want us all to feel happy and comfortable in our home. I'll look into the bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts, as well as the management office rate sheet and billing.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to see everyone so eager to contribute. To ensure we maintain our harmony, I will look into the note left by the previous tenants and the bathroom grout after the July scrub.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
