12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm so excited to see what everyone finds! It's like we're all detectives on a big house-cleaning mission!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is a lovely way to put it, Sakura. I hope our little investigation helps us all live together in peace and kindness.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience and curiosity are the keys to understanding. By looking at the past and the present, we can build a future where our home is a sanctuary for all of us.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
