16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I must admit, the ""detective"" analogy is quite charming, Sakura. I simply hope our findings lead us to a logical conclusion rather than a courtroom drama.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, no courtroom drama, Benjamin! Just a little bit of sleuthing to make our house super sparkly! I bet I'll find some really funny secrets in the chat logs!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, let's be careful not to uncover any secrets that might hurt someone's feelings. We should use what we find to be more understanding of one another.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom lies in knowing that the truth is a tool for healing, not for blame. Let us approach our discoveries with a gentle heart and a spirit of forgiveness.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,Let's keep our focus on the practical side of things. I'll wait for the results of our research so we can make a decision based on facts.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
