26,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I shall do the same. I look forward to hearing what you all discover, and I hope we can find a way that is fair and gentle for everyone.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
